  "description": "⭐ <em>The world's premier tour of its kind, </em><strong><em>Silent Discos In Incredible Places</em></strong><em>, is returning to the world-famous British Museum on Saturday 5 September 2026 after 3 consecutive sell-outs! Expect some of the UK's best DJs playing all the tunes that have defined decades to over 2000 people in the stunning, illuminated surroundings of The British Museum.&nbsp;</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🎧 Some of the UK’s best DJs playing your favourite decade-defining hits&nbsp;<br>\n🔥 The British Museum illuminated like you’ve never seen before&nbsp;<br>\n💖 State-of-the-art LED headphones with three channels of music to choose from<br>\n🥳 2000+ music fans partying in the heart of one of the UK’s most architecturally stunning buildings<br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Date: Saturday 5 September 2026<br>\n🕒 Time: 7:30 PM – 10:30 PM - <strong>last entry is at 8:45pm </strong><br>\n⏳ Duration: 3 hours&nbsp;<br>\n📍 Location: The British Museum<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID&nbsp;<br>\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible&nbsp;<br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vS4GWF7uwJdVotkTmwmKHvkKT8sVzDGOvmyAHlh1Opk_SUOrrNFsNOc4jAi9lMgKgB_WHFhbIRGIqv-/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nGet ready for a feel-good silent disco in the Great Court of The British Museum! Whether you're a fan of 80s anthems, 90s floor-fillers, or today's chart-toppers, we’ve gathered the UK’s finest DJs to battle it out for your attention. Join 2,000 music fans for a surreal experience as you party the night away in one of most breathtaking, illuminated spaces on Earth. So grab your headphones, pick your channel, and get ready to dance among the sculptures. Get your tickets today!",
